# Project Structure

## Workspaces
- `apps/www` – Next.js 16 (React 19), Tailwind v3, `@` → `./src/*`
- `apps/api` – Hono server with Drizzle ORM (Postgres)

## Paths
- Web components in `apps/www/src/components`
- UI primitives in `apps/www/src/components/ui`
- Shared utils in `apps/www/src/lib`

## Conventions
- When renaming/moving files, update all imports accordingly
- Delete obsolete code when replaced by new implementations
- New files/folders use clear, English names aligned with current structure
- Follow existing API and UI patterns before introducing new ones
